# Copy to .env for machine-local overrides. Loading order per project:
#   .env.base -> .env (solution root) -> <project>/.env.base -> <project>/.env
# Later files win. Comments must sit on their own line — inline comments parse
# differently across tools.

# Where ticker snapshots are cached (default: <solution root>/.artifacts/market).
# SUWALSKI_MARKET_CACHE=/var/cache/suwalski-market

# SEC EDGAR asks automated callers to identify themselves; requests without a User-Agent
# are refused. Put your own "name email" here and export it into the environment.
# SEC_USER_AGENT=Your Name your@email.example

# Tickers EDGAR has no ticker on record for (several ADRs). Format: TICKER:CIK, comma
# separated. Without an entry the symbol simply falls back to the provider's shorter history.
# SEC_CIK_OVERRIDES=SE:1703399
